  "description": "Le CLASH 20 propose une configuration adaptée aux jeunes riders avec 125 mm de débattement.\n• The MANITOU Junit Pro fork offers 120mm of travel. It was specially developed with the American brand to deliver maximum performance for children's weight with simple-to-use adjustments.\n• The ROCKSHOX Deluxe Select shock offers an internal setting specifically selected for the frame's kinematics to accommodate lightweight riders.\n• The TEKTRO HD-J3120 hydraulic brakes deliver power suited for kids with levers designed with small hands in mind.\n• The MICROSHIFT Advent X transmission is a drivetrain developed for children with excellent shifter ergonomics and a gear range that allows you to go anywhere.",
